\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 5. Professional vs. Home Gear\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f3\b0\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Home:
\f1\b0  Most consumers use an "all-in-one" device that combines the router, switch, firewall, and access point .{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S7MNX_UD7vY&t=426"}}{\fldrslt \uc0\u8232 }}\
