\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Level 1: The Chatter (Surface Level)	\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 This is the most basic, common, and least efficient way to use AI.\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls14\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 What it looks like:
\f1\b0  You treat AI like a search engine or a basic messaging tool. You log into ChatGPT,Claude, or Gemini to ask a single, standalone question .\
\ls14\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1\fs26 \
\ls14\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Common Use Cases:
\f1\b0  Asking for a travel itinerary, writing a basic text message, or asking "how-to" questions (e.g., how to apply for a visa) .\
\ls14\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1\fs26 \
\ls14\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 The Problem:
\f1\b0  You only look at the immediate surface capability and miss out on roughly 90% of what the AI can actually do for you.\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f6\fs32 \cf0 \uc0\u9881 \u65039 
\f0\b  Level 2: The Multi-Modal Power User\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\fs26 \cf0 \

\f1\b0 At this level, you stop just chatting and start utilizing the diverse formats AI can handle.\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls15\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 What it looks like:
\f1\b0  You know how to write better prompts. You follow a structured ramework by setting a 
\f0\b role
\f1\b0  for the AI, giving it 
\f0\b context
\f1\b0  about the problem,                                                                                                                                     and clearly stating your output 
\f0\b expectations{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NPizttuM9kI&t=129"}}{\fldrslt 
\f1\b0 \ul  }}
\f1\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls16\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Common Use Cases:
\f1\b0  Asking AI to generate images, create PDFs, compile documents, or conduct deeper research {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NPizttuM9kI&t=110"}}{\fldrslt \ul  }}.\
\ls16\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1\fs26 \
\ls16\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 The Pitfall (The "Prompstitute"):
\f1\b0  Users at this level often start trusting AI 
\f5\i too
\f1\i0  much. They copy-paste AI responses blindly without verifyingfacts or consulting humans{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NPizttuM9kI&t=194"}}{\fldrslt \ul  }}. They overlook the fact that the AI doesn't know their full life context.\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f6\fs32 \cf0 \uc0\u55358 \u56800 
\f0\b  Level 3: The Context Engineer\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 This is the first major "unlock" where you transition from simply using AI to actively shaping it .\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls17\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 What it looks like:
\f1\b0  You realize that the quality of AI output depends directly on the depth of context you provide. Instead of blank chat windows, you build environments where the AI is fully trained on specific parameters .\
\ls17\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Common Use Cases:
\f1\b0  * 
\f0\b Claude Projects / Custom GPTs:
\f1\b0  Creating a workspace pre-loaded with your guidelines. (e.g., Ishan uploads his brand guidelines so Claude automatically generates 10 relevant YouTube thumbnail concepts or initial Instagram reel drafts) .\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls17\ilvl1
\f3\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Virtual Mentors via Notebook LM:
\f1\b0  Dropping all YouTube transcripts and podcasts of figures like Elon Musk or Mukesh Ambani into Notebook LM to safely "chat" with their collective thought processes.\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f6\fs32 \cf0 \uc0\u55358 \u56598 
\f0\b  Level 4: The Automator\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 At this stage, you stop manually prompting the AI and begin setting up workflows that run in the background.\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls18\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 What it looks like:
\f1\b0  You use tools to connect applications via APIs and build scheduled tasks so AI works for you while you sleep {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NPizttuM9kI&t=532"}}{\fldrslt \ul  }}.\
\ls18\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Key Tools Used:
\f1\b0  Claude Co-work, Claude Code, OpenAI's Codeex, and n8n (for drag-and-drop workflow building) .\
\ls18\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Example Workflow:
\f1\b0  Ishan sets a daily automation where at 10:00 AM, an AI extension automatically scans X (formerly Twitter), extracts the top 10 viral AI tweets, and instantly rewrites them into 10 video scripts for his channel\'97saving hours of manual research .\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f6\fs32 \cf0 \uc0\u55357 \u56508 
\f0\b  Level 5: The Agent Builder (The Top 1%)\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 This is the ultimate tier where AI is used to create massive value, build products, and generate income {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NPizttuM9kI&t=554"}}{\fldrslt \ul  }}.\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls19\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 What it looks like:
\f1\b0  You aren't just automating personal tasks; you are building cloud-hosted AI agents and selling those solutions to enterprises for thousands of dollars .\
\ls19\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Key Concepts:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls19\ilvl1
\f3\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Vibe Coding:
\f1\b0  Building, adding payment gateways, and launching fully functional apps to app stores purely using AI code .\
\ls19\ilvl1
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 AI Influencers:
\f1\b0  Creating synthetic personalities using image generators (like Nano Banana) and state-of-the-art video motion tools (like Seed Dance 2.0) . These AI accounts gain followers and secure lucrative brand sponsorship deals anonymously .\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
